\f0\fs24 \cf0 # PROJECT SPECIFICATION: \'abCOZY SOUND ROOM\'bb (UNITY AUDIO-DIORAMA)\
\
## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW\
* **Project Name:** Cozy Sound Room\
* **Engine:** Unity (2D/Isometric 3D)\
* **Genre:** Interactive Audio-Diorama / Lo-Fi Music Sandbox\
* **Core Philosophy:** Cozy, tactile, low-stress environment where the player creates musical Lo-Fi mixes by toggling living interior objects. The player character remains off-screen.\
\
---\
\
## 2. CORE ARCHITECTURAL PILLARS\
\
### A. Procedural Environment Generator (PEG)\
1. **Time-of-Day & Season System:**\
   * Reads system calendar and clock (`System.DateTime.Now`).\
   * Determines Season modifier (`Winter`/`Spring`/`Summer`/`Autumn`) to apply static seasonal room styling, exterior views, and filter available weather states.\
   * Determines global lighting preset and biological soundscape:\
     * `Morning` (06:00\'9611:00): Warm rose/gold light, birdsong.\
     * `Day` (11:00\'9617:00): Bright neutral light, light wind/swallows.\
     * `Evening` (17:00\'9622:00): Golden hour/amber light, crickets.\
     * `Night` (22:00\'9606:00): Deep indigo light, fireflies, cicadas/owls.\
2. **Weather Generator (RNG):**\
   * Generated strictly by random seed on startup (no manual switching).\
   * 7 states: `Clear`, `Light Rain`, `Heavy Downpour`, `Thunderstorm`, `Snowfall`, `Blizzard`, `Hail`.\
   * Directly modulates weather particles, ambient sound beds (rain, thunder, wind), and window opacity.\
\
### B. Room Scene Architecture & Spawn Layers\
1. **Static Architectural Layer:** Fixed room box (walls, wooden floor, window aperture, fireplace mantle, sofa, shelving, primary tables).\
2. **Deterministic Seasonal Layer:** Dedicated anchor points populated based on the detected season:\
   * `Spring`: Pastel throws, light rug, vase with willow/blossoms, clay pot with sprout, sheer curtains.\
   * `Summer`: Wicker mat, bare armchair, wild flowers, fruit bowl, straw hat on chair, ajar window frame.\
   * `Autumn`: Plaid wool blanket, terracotta cushions, clay jug with maple leaves and rowan berries, decorative pumpkin on mantle.\
   * `Winter`: Chunky knit blanket, fluffy rug, vase with pine branches/cones/cinnamon, pine garland/wreath on mantle, frosty window corners.\
3. **Dynamic Interactive Layer (Spawn System):** An array of typed spawn points. On each session start, the system selects exactly 80% of the interactive prop pool and places them on valid spawn points, keeping every launch unique.\
\
### C. Multi-Track Audio Engine & Export\
* **DSP Synchronization:** All audio stems start synchronously at `volume = 0` via master timer (`AudioSettings.dspTime`). Strict 75 BPM and matching key across all stems.\
* **Interaction:** Clicking an object triggers smooth volume interpolation (`Fade In / Fade Out`) and activates linked animations.\
* **Audio-Reactive Lighting:** Internal lights (garland, candles) sample audio levels/bass frequencies to dynamically pulse in rhythm.\
* **Audio Recording & Export:** Recording the `AudioListener` stream in real-time, buffering PCM data, and saving to disk as a `.wav` file.\
\
