## 3. INTERACTIVE ASSET MATRIX\
\
### A. Sound-Producing Props (Stems \'97 Seamless 75 BPM Loops)\
1. `Cat (on armchair/rug)`: Bass purring track. *(Double Click: stretches, extends claws, emits soft sleepy "mrow")*.\
2. `Tea Cup with Spoon`: Percussive ceramic/metal clinking. *(Double Click: steam twists into a musical note/heart shape)*.\
3. `Fireplace`: Crackling wood and low rumble. *(Double Click: mini burst of festive sparks/flares)*.\
4. `Open Book`: Soft periodic page rustling. *(Double Click: rapid page fanning releasing a glowing paper butterfly)*.\
5. `Creaky Floorboard`: Low wooden creak on strong downbeats. *(Double Click: tiny mouse/spider peeks out from baseboard)*.\
6. `Aquarium with Light`: Air filter hum and bubbling (shaker role).\
7. `Knitting Basket (Needles & Yarn)`: Rhythmic wooden needle clicking.\
8. `Wind Chimes (by window)`: Crystal/metallic harmonic chime.\
9. `Dreamcatcher (on wall)`: Feather and bead fluttering.\
10. `Crystal Chandelier`: High-frequency subtle chime + light caustics.\
11. `Wall Clock with Pendulum`: Muffled ticking metronome.\
12. `Vintage Vinyl Player`: Vinyl crackle + melodic Lo-Fi loop.\
\
### B. Atmosphere-Only Objects (No Direct Sound)\
1. `String Garland`: Audio-reactive dynamic light pulse.\
2. `Table Candle`: Organic flicker reacting to bass frequencies.\
3. `Window Curtains`: Physics/wind sway altering interior shadow shapes.\
\
### C. UI & Navigation Controls\
1. `Custom Cursor`: Vintage magic wand (Default state) $\\rightarrow$ Glowing magic wand with micro-sparks (Hover on interactive props).\
2. `Splash / Pre-scene`: Entry screen with lock/handle click to initialize WebGL/Mobile audio context.\
3. `Control Bar`: `REC / Stop`, `Export WAV`, `Reset / Clear All`, `Play All`, `Screenshot Mode`, `Info / Help`, `Master Volume Slider`.\
